Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：为了救德之助{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德鲁瓦和戈什与两人的决斗开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且不知为何星光体没有现身。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶　那群家伙的攻击毫不留情地持续着。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊。　再这样下去我……＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我守卫者。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（刀锋保镖）喔～。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）把手里牌削到零
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来保住怪兽也是白费力气。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌为零？　没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动墓地里的帮一把骑士的怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在墓地　且手牌为零
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到怪兽攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且　结束这个回合的战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（帮一把骑士）嘿咻。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.99,0:00:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喔～。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）怪兽的攻击停下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 总算是撑住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 真是个难缠的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 我的回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.91,0:01:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上有两只等级4的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.78,0:01:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里召唤霍普的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.47,0:01:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.67,0:01:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 轮到你这家伙的回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.70,0:01:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那家伙不在的话就呼唤不了霍普》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.82,0:01:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在看哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.11,0:01:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。 霍普 到游马身边去。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马需要你。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.73,0:01:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会让你逃掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.13,0:01:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.15,0:02:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 就算霍普不在。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《用这张卡打不倒那些家伙的怪兽》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。 我用帮凶骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.57,0:02:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击幻蝶刺客 摩芙。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帮推。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（摩芙）啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.53,0:02:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（抽卡者）呜。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切 才500点？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.89,0:02:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这点气势可打不倒我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.61,0:02:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.56,0:02:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了小鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧给我回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来给你最后一击。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶。 我盖一张卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喔噢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.35,0:03:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.63,0:03:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么只有霍普？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 在吗？ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.45,0:03:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 星光体你出了什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.69,0:03:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 让他跑了吗。 但是 星光体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.39,0:03:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 能保护你的人已经没有了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.26,0:03:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了区区人类 真是个蠢货。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 No.怪兽们。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们就由我来吸收掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 这些家伙就归我支配了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.18,0:03:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来轮到你了 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚 刚才那道光是什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.93,0:04:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}样子不太对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点 高什。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的卡好像回来了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……难道说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也在某处战斗着吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以至少让我来用这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.43,0:04:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是这样的话 你的心意我不会让它白费的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.31,0:04:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级４的嘎嘎嘎守卫和
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.39,0:04:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帮一把骑士进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.３９ 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（霍普）霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.21,0:04:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不…不可能…居然是 No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那小子居然有 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:04:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.３９……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.19,0:05:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普 撑住啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.54,0:05:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放１张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙　变得有意思起来了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点　戈什。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合　抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤　月光蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等德罗瓦。　那家伙我说过是我的猎物。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然知道他持有 No.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是　为了心园先生的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.22,0:05:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧…　真是个不解风情的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.75,0:05:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将　等级４　幻蝶刺客凤蝶和
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月光蝶进行超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.31,0:05:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.05,0:05:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧　光子蝴蝶刺客！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（光子蝴蝶刺客）哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:05:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.78,0:06:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种怪兽 我从来没见过啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽是……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和快斗用过的怪兽一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 会用和快斗一样的光子怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 怎么会知道快斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死心吧！ 就算逃也没用。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我们来帮你想起 我们的使命。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}问我为什么当然是因为跟他决斗过啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然没分出胜负就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？ 那你是说跟快斗那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打成了平手？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.14,0:08:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 这种小鬼居然能和快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说…… 心园先生说过。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体世界的使者 No.卡的原版
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.40,0:08:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来到了这个世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！ 难道说那个小鬼身上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带着原版卡吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.15,0:08:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}若不是这样的话 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙能和快斗打成平手？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.03,0:08:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是这么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然知道是原创卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小子 你的那些 No.卡就让我来回收吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要开始了 No.卡狩猎。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:08:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:09:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子蝴蝶刺客的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.17,0:09:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.53,0:09:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将守备表示怪兽变为攻击表示
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并使其攻击力下降600。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普变成攻击表示了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你打算加固防守对我们也没用。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 速攻魔法狂战鳞片！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1只怪兽的攻击力直到这个回合结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升１０００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力３１００！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.83,0:09:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来攻击力的差距就是１２００。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽虽然不会被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.30,0:09:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但伤害你还是得吃下。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说如果这次攻击成功的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！光子蝴蝶刺客
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝴蝶死亡之舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动希望皇霍普的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:10:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗１个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让１只怪兽的攻击无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼。得救了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.21,0:10:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.07,0:10:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到狂战鳞效果影响的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束时攻击力恢复{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且再下降１０００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过　这样一来希望皇霍普的效果　我就清楚了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈什！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来交给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识见识我真正的气势！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级４的刀刃拳击手解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级６的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}幻影拳击手升级召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（幻影拳击手）喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级６的怪兽有２只！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将　等级６的锤击拳击手和
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.13,0:10:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}幻影拳击手叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.99,0:10:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:10:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子奔流保镖！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（光子奔流保镖）呜哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力2700！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，这下就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.99,0:11:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用光子奔流保镖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.03,0:11:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！奔流强袭！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之护盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中计了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子奔流保镖的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方的怪兽超量效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给予1000点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说是为了让霍普的效果发动！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本以为躲过了800点伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果反而吃了1000点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:11:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:12:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，抓到你了，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！光子奔流保镖！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.93,0:12:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奔流破击！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！伤害节食！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.59,0:12:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合，自己受到的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果伤害减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.35,0:12:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！因为霍普的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被无效了，战斗继续！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！光子奔流保镖！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:13:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就是游马输了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 No.卡的原版就归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！发动陷阱卡 半·破！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到这张卡效果的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.90,0:13:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 战斗中不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.23,0:13:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对玩家造成的伤害减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.47,0:13:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 居然撑住了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.36,0:13:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这样一来霍普的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材已经用完了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖牌也没有了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.61,0:13:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样投降
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把 No.卡交给我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.67,0:13:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话 就不用再受苦了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.41,0:13:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁……谁会 向你们这种人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.78,0:13:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游……游马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:14:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错……这场决斗要是输了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.34,0:14:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不只是我那家伙也会消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事，我怎么可能让你得逞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧……我盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.51,0:14:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 卡片车·D！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.33,0:14:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这张卡解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.80,0:14:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能从敌人那里抽两张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.35,0:14:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《来吧》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逆转的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.95,0:14:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《双重机会和 加倍紧张…》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，动脑子想…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.90,0:14:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好想。一定有什么办法…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.77,0:15:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定还有哪里有机会，有什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.05,0:15:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的终于肯放弃了是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.15,0:15:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放弃了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行了，已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.89,0:15:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可以放弃乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那才是游马的对决乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.99,0:15:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管失败多少次不管被嘲笑多少次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.19,0:16:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马都从来没有放弃过。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.72,0:16:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坚持到最后，不要放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟… 德之助…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊胜负还没分出来呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能放弃啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管多少次，我都会一飞冲天。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…我感觉得到你的那股一飞冲天…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.87,0:16:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.51,0:16:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…身体好像要被撕裂了一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.73,0:16:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我和游马我们之间羁绊的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:17:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}羁绊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.81,0:17:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.35,0:17:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你久等了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）什…什么？那是什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）这样啊，那家伙就是本体。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？我才没有特别在意你什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可等不下去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种家伙我一个人就够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 你总是在关键时刻不见人影{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在无所谓的时候又冒出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《两个人一起对付游马…》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.23,0:17:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜利的豌豆已经凑齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的战斗 并非徒劳。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:17:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:18:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 要赢啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.67,0:18:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.85,0:18:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 首先 发动墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.01,0:18:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放吞噬者的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 墓地里的 叠放吞噬者的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.27,0:18:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放吞噬者？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.15,0:18:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 那个时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了发动我我我守卫者的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送进墓地的说啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马／星光体）将墓地里的这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.09,0:18:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从游戏中除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}吸收{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}对{\fnYusei Magic}方怪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}兽{\fnYusei Magic}・超量怪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}兽{\fnYusei Magic}的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.57,0:18:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}变{\fnYusei Magic}成自己怪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}兽{\fnYusei Magic}・超量怪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}兽{\fnYusei Magic}的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来　光子奔流猎豹的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果就被封住了说啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.21,0:18:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今　再摆那种架势也太晚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）用希望皇霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.79,0:18:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击光子蝶刺客。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.63,0:18:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区　８００点伤害而已……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马／星光体）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动希望皇霍普的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.35,0:18:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效１只怪兽的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:19:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效自己的攻击！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）从手牌发动　速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}翻倍机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当怪兽的攻击被无效时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.33,0:19:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽可以再次进行攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.86,0:19:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此时的攻击力会变成两倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.56,0:19:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力变成了两倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.41,0:19:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 还不够哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.43,0:19:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）并且 从手牌发动 速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}二重张力！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽进行第二次攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.52,0:19:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力会再次变成两倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 7600！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.92,0:19:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）霍普剑 火星斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱！ 弹跳卫士！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.24,0:19:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手怪兽的攻击对象
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变更为冠有“弹跳”之名的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜！啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.43,0:20:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了～！游马赢了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害啊乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.66,0:20:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种情况下居然一口气逆转了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然星光体是决斗的天才乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.41,0:20:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛痛痛……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.78,0:20:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要拿我当替身？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.63,0:20:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿，为什么嘛，就是气氛啦，气氛。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.51,0:20:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然是托星光体的福呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）喂，小子。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照约定，作弊的事我就忘了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.25,0:20:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，你给我记住。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次我一定要打倒你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和 No.卡的原版一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随时奉陪到底！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我看上你了，就冲你这股劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，总之不管怎么说这事就这么圆满解决啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.19,0:21:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.36,0:21:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢骗我！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我的心灵碎片还回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜、呜、呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站住！喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.37,0:21:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走吧，各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是场无妄之灾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没、没了！我的心灵碎片不见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.37,0:21:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦，今天的事对心园先生{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.07,0:21:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是不会报告的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.67,0:21:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个原型，由我来打倒{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.12,0:21:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抢在快斗前面。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，行吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（太一）嗯～没有啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.90,0:22:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪里有没有掉落的爱心碎片呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.78,0:22:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（奥博特）打扫打扫。

